      "derivationNotes": "Same banner + tabbed profile layout as EmployeeProfile but in create/edit mode. Banner shows placeholder avatar with 'Add photo' button. Name/title fields are inline editable inputs. The first tab (Personal info) is open with empty form fields: First Name, Last Name, Work email, Personal email, Phone, Start date, Employment type, Department dropdown, Manager (employee picker), Office location, Employee ID (auto-generated, mono font, read-only). Replace the right-side action buttons with primary 'Save employee' and ghost 'Cancel'. Hide tabs that require an existing record (Time off, Documents, Audit log) — show a muted hint 'Available after the employee is created'."
